  "Question": "In cyclic quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\), extend \\(BC\\) to point \\(E\\). Given \\(\\angle DCE=80^\\circ\\), find \\(\\angle A\\) in degrees.",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "80",
